{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1222,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2503da21ea73948ee5bd8304",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你做好紧跟着「女杰」的\r\n心理准备了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "604ea264f7619e498342ececf6cbbb23a01d62d5d53ab6ab1b15a9ce4ae7f7c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc3ccefeb3fad8f3290a324d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机会难得，我们两个\r\n把蛋糕切一切分来吃吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0265d7c78da53c9e082cf0f17581b61f21921ffa78e507c3bf728c184d285fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ad8641e635666145ddf71c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f913ac6ea8110821d188785bd378043d1e5921f031c98c1bb24b8b64a2253bb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3b0fa32de368305c869897c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要单挑的话我随时奉陪哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75cf3da6e8a74ee88921b84114c000e5a4ace0a3d47051853f86c3490375af33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:149dd13ad91870013460d428",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "燃えるような赤だろ？\r\nへへっ、気に入ってるのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d226f92365adf4ccf9801e607f82ad51c46dd9d55c3cea24c7b9df5e7eb50ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18010a52a42686970b387b98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さーて、出かけるよ。\r\n買う物がたくさんあるんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b2de466ea8c3f076f206253d43c51c4bba95a1f036d33565d3e6f015d46cf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41241d356ab197f57a36aac8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，还蛮适合我的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba7a6424b82239325e26b0b807ea78ce6107603650e45103c01a162ca5c870fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:806efdf1ea22a8d4380df27b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然设计是我不太习惯的那种……\r\n但还不差啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fd0a291f384124f3c347f8fd790091dd0f74a742c0ca8efa330dfe3d61d6c9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b41c9d8d9aa0d2973023c2cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然只要穿着这身的话情绪会高涨起来呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "333c5b7cc242a67c315dc6c5ba8229db8160f992fcc930302ddb242fcaa6b9b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de5cf0ddd895f0d77d3b2bc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件制服即轻快、又很方便活动身体呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23dd90e047fda5a9ef25124ff0aaa21b251db0359215f4cda04fdc66b5ddba63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8812312cd1a3005c4a5d5893",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为设计太可爱了，所以稍微觉得有点害羞呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3011401b87336164ac4e20df372956d1f6dbbba699674c61bb7e8b57389bce4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdb6f38ae041234f4fbdb8c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿着这身的话、\r\n就会变得像来场热烈的比赛了啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "161fd72a5f3a4811bf89d9f1be9adc3716cc4725f5c28a4d5cb0953d6d2cb2aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49dc3bb4d5a85b3893f1a313",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你做好紧跟着「女杰」的\r\n心理准备了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "604ea264f7619e498342ececf6cbbb23a01d62d5d53ab6ab1b15a9ce4ae7f7c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4e95de779a61c18defa487d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机会难得，我们两个\r\n把蛋糕切一切分来吃吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0265d7c78da53c9e082cf0f17581b61f21921ffa78e507c3bf728c184d285fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b47792aa648306a0fb9bc41b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f913ac6ea8110821d188785bd378043d1e5921f031c98c1bb24b8b64a2253bb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6dcf1d27ea321ffd59a1d72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要单挑的话我随时奉陪哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75cf3da6e8a74ee88921b84114c000e5a4ace0a3d47051853f86c3490375af33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbea1ab8271e4eba69cf538e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:914b9909da49cce257fc88cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要和我一决胜负吗？\r\n行啊，放马过来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a4d2a6efb785cab417238248ff26d4f07e4913a335f35e6fb929897a7de19b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8af697010df25767c2581897",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始变得有趣起来了啊！\r\n那么，我可要动真格了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7872cacc131ac98acf48821ac036fa248c719430f06485efc73ad73b61055d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b9882b8e744e9b4fdbfcd0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好啊、训练公！\r\n你看上去很精神就比什么都好啦。\r\n精神不饱满的话可算不上一天之始呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "135306fe7a96d358214281b97be42b3688139383f7a875fa0a0c803b01f1ff6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d959e2f915edb3923c403055",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别犯迷糊了、给我清醒一点呀。\r\n你要是不昂首挺胸的话，还怎么做表率啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0569516dc6fc467b5c0af6193b94b3c06da37ffe523f7d2c3e56275499def42e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2368005a58382e9c57d60f24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜、嗝……真没想到会有人向我发出\r\n大胃王挑战呢……\r\n我也、得锻炼一下胃容量才行了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e16f3360c3a6f324e5baa8d37c5ecb7d1f8369ae6df73aadec2e247ea77c2c08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1e5c70046a8634c30f4ec87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不就稍微睡个午觉吧。\r\n毕竟到下午又得要继续加油了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ac10385ca371ea095fe1b756013f80b94f417dfda6fa13733c5451339b10f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:557a24a910b5a69e22bce953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么——又到了我最辛苦的时候了呢……\r\n要是大伙都能遵守门禁时间就好了啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a842a0222027ff779991feb390afe88ea0f156afae46ec7453133334da5bae7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbd306a7183ae45f17739244",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，看上去还在努力工作呢。\r\n但是、可别太勉强自己了啊。\r\n和菱亚马逊姐约好了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7594a01f9bdd4ec121b89e03bf6d2764a22612ce27b211bb5eb9fca07edb13a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff6325af96e839f26a5a3e1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早春的空气就是让人心情舒畅啊！\r\n训练公，洗衣服的话就趁着还早吧！\r\n我也会来搭把手的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde76050736355e00ee2b81a045db8dec74f91f46cf8eb9d66d2550b95a10242",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2674616de3b3e475219f9d08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节可得好好补充水分哦。\r\n啊……不过、只是单纯补水的话可不行哟？\r\n盐分也得一起好好地摄取才行",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d75fb0340e1ccca8fd2df22b2301642466ddc8f17d6e82b754f475a9dfaf6bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf8e6187e629d7afc7146372",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一到秋天的时候太阳就会落的很快呢。\r\n所以要做的事、\r\n就趁着天还亮着的时候赶紧做好吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ecf913ad9a412b22edd39b09c4e1061fbe603e96eae05735fb61a30b3668f61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc16a0cdf84a7ebf5f5f27df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天的话喝点姜汤会比较好哦。\r\n喝完之后心里都变得暖洋洋的、\r\n无论天气有多冷都没问题了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d830eda4cab9b67b9eec28119dec242d5f6b31ac54d69e9a898c468d75ec39fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:241b3fd8d6517cd5363abf91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你喜欢吃甜的还是咸的玉子烧？\r\n今天就由大姐我\r\n帮你做一份特制便当！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2e11300dc4b0f65167e7ef78058be2219ac8f4f8fcbc5d2599e0806404c45cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b738677370b64eb1ac228f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要好好加油啊。\r\n──喔，等等！……真是的。\r\n你看，领子皱掉了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1166fb30626a5248513d2580fa6bf5a4ba4d49b86a5682419acc81e6e170cbb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3be5552dccdd9817a9b042c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～！逼白仁吃蔬菜\r\n花了我不少时间！\r\n好啦，我也来吃午饭吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "526b5f9bb47b097ea6ef5cf6d4cfecc8a74e45d321b3ad695c218439efa831d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f342c3d6ee232d7f7a9979a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要不要去我老家的大众食堂？\r\n午餐的菜单有你应该会\r\n喜欢的定食哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4601203fc0c6dcaceec89daeeb6de1dc347a497f11261ff7cfddd6c29602072",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ec31637c601bc036cedf78f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说伏特加和赤骥\r\n还没回到宿舍。真是……\r\n我去操场看看好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "935dd9ac5a64ccc0630a3126f9c87d5cd7afa590be803bfcd814404ef3caeae9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f649c83e19c724806bf30fc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也辛苦啦！\r\n别熬夜了，快去睡吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eaccd5b9c8238a69f2625c3873f9c7246c81e563e85e23039bf002da064bf1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:871e85d1751dfe2816376787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也该去赏花了吧。\r\n饭团的馅料……\r\n就放一堆你爱吃的东西吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc25352605b1f368c594349ec5997e3ee97d0b6323e1eacf50cd760a9f723063",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5906abf83f0f207215f19807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别看这套衣服很普通，它的\r\n快干效果超好的！这个时期衣服\r\n很快就干可是帮了我大忙。嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d9c2df0fa472104b83e414fcde4817f22a9bc613c8d6659736807a92bf91b31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31f8bcf713e1941155e6d69f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大概是因为秋天到，宿舍的学生\r\n很容易饿，白饭一下就被吃光了！\r\n不过，有精神是好事啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36890f0b3681bf05128dde26027e82473829ce596319424ccf06f070605e64fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:174ba2d2fff54d5578098622",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～冷死了！\r\n今天一定要吃火锅！\r\n加一堆姜和胡萝卜的热腾腾火锅！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d039140a1c91c1e69bda4d69c6f6e52a99b9a25d215181ad70e4e396653ec550",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36531b7b74970ee81a7f5838",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00ca9e7ad20a67e5e00c5da5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb4e7b23cbe50f205ace0927",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次想给宿舍里的小家伙们的衣服上\r\n绣上刺绣章的时候她们就都跑开了啊\r\n……就那么讨厌吗、青虫的刺绣章。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef140e01e9b7b6e576795bc1238672db850aa14562b32006c442f363bdeb1d32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3398cc4bc54a5b483d92d962",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……真是的。想要恶作剧的话\r\n就给我堂堂正正的干啊。突然从背后\r\n挠痒痒什么的太卑鄙了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "66ec249278e49e77de4bf776ae4c7af1e9dd196ccc8fd9338df26ea97d1a7e30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0cba3d0143ffe3eb103b9bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞驹她教了我一些很帅的动作啊！\r\n这次的比赛要是赢了的话，就做给你看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c4696212bd5cb0f86c1d7c4b452ee1a62c1737794d2cd8db32bbee5e6309435",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed5972942d5fbd5baa33489c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“像老妈一样”…啊没有啦、和阿雪\r\n一起洗衣服的时候被她这么说了…\r\n我的衣品有这么老气吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e38f5387891d71df026c0e747c9c8dfc214400adfdd6eff58eda293ef868c4f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f85aa3c8527337abffae732e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别再发呆了哦。\r\n在菱亚马逊姐面前、你可不准怠慢哟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21757a468aeb708a6911865893c22ff5f2208c7e7e38fbee38054b0455b13346",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdfeb065ac5fc9aa0e4e1f29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让你看到最棒的表演哦！\r\n回应粉丝的应援也是我们应该做的对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a55b4cd075f585576331eebd92cd39b3551b869e396fa9e826f4cc8a9ae60c82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e5fd83c3dcc4dc7d9b84d49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服，感觉真拘束啊……\r\n稍微脱一件不行吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "74bea6bff491fe2a2b56ae81c5e33d6d83f9b8870453f734b1a808051186a8a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:043b4c9174219b4462260bd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为穿着这件决胜服、\r\n所以不全力取胜可不行啊。\r\n要问为什么的话，因为这样很引人注目啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec683d8b29c6b024688d14446fdad4e2d109eebb616c14ff40c3b7da5fb7276",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f20ad5a47bd0077b18b4c07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身动起来很方便不是很好嘛！\r\n不管对手是谁、我都觉得能够大胜而归哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc060111e679978db233b2166f578d8e9025013cf4c00619508555d02a5c6c53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:474760396e355a6719b25f84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听我说啊！今天的我在闹钟\r\n响之前就起床了哦！\r\n呀～心情真好啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fa941f60e8ed2e92959056cb901c4ba9f877c026af9a5a0245199206b1e4bea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a9d83bc9e2e9063f62ec0c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一副肚子饿了的表情呢。\r\n要给你做点啥吃的吗？虽然也就只能\r\n做个土豆炖肉或者是鸡蛋烧啥的就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15bdf6d255b0cf64f30b53e9089e0246beb35d3b3b9596f84ff9db3f1840f57b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef9f5bbd4aa3e1db98d9f1d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好险啊……和白仁她一起跑步、\r\n一不注意就忘记时间了…身为宿舍长\r\n却超过门禁时间的话可笑不出来啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78d8ae7d38433d15a1956325fe7bf2751b9fe999be0642e02ee32bd034a2fb92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:663706c6600b14157343670c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带新生参观学园真累人啊……\r\n嘛、但只要看到那份闪闪发光的脸庞的话\r\n、马上就能打起精神了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36e5a52a4c4fd1665f03dae0c550dd700147e361954cc217db56fd5c54c40c12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03ab5cedb806f05e2c3c9e79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每到夏天的时候要洗的衣服就会变多呢……\r\n只是准备好晾衣服的地方就很累了呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41f07a82a72c0e84be949385f232ca001a120973317ce2cb51b7f5b378d51792",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1095ef07440aaabea925004d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然红叶很漂亮、\r\n但一想到扫落叶的事是要自己干、\r\n就感觉心情稍微有点复杂呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b324975e4040b4325d2bbe9d0e7dc3df32fa97c66d4dc081dd2c21a54421680d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ce96931f26cac7ab9df14b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总感觉很冷呢。\r\n这种时候就好好地搓搓手吧。\r\n会暖起来的哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98bd236f613b9fac9bd9548597ec50c7fc5d589d0da02958780fec916d0f310e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3139d5bd0a9fa4279bbe6ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你看到小花的婚纱打扮了吗？\r\n那套可爱的衣服很适合她，\r\n都让我想东摸摸西摸摸了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03482c362a4abc800742f67a6c36af38b4660869c2163a467040bbb115385fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f07e5fcb4287895fecf303e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有帮她织过小真娃娃。\r\n她说让她开心到不行，\r\n还很宝贝地收在抽屉里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6b797ccefa4d0c01491ae3b1692767958544b174c8d36cd02695cccd8865991",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6b264f5815ddbcd96f5c4c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "她说「我还以为你是故事里的\r\n公主」。能不能想办法矫正一下\r\n富士爱说花言巧语的习惯啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5a1cca39dd999e15bc8435ef8265c4c53005cdb29b0e095f8b102d1b34797eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40533b39334b4a434192e876",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我哥哥姐姐都很乖巧。\r\n多亏如此，\r\n我这个老么长成这样了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "367870a2bf56a7b9991d133d4a2c5fd6098aaab1b4ee8f5bd20fc1f260471bf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d93d19047896d63a9610fd13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望人家怎么跟我求婚是吗？\r\n……唔，伤脑筋。我只想得到\r\n自己跟人求婚的模样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1d21dbd008947010a1afb0b76a29a7da9d52641abdce0439d799dbe3f4de3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d67a5d3da24a9f480caa6f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们有很多学生早上爬不起来。\r\n今天早上我也担心她们会迟到，\r\n一整个提心吊胆的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7e3706a183d28b4667511eeec2e7b7377b7b3e6773232664bc73ac3ca83deed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c67842c00d0331c5ab58b8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，吃便当的时间到了！\r\n如果天气好的话，\r\n就到顶楼看看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cbec02a3d7dacd365e1cbdeb4ae8d0e99709c0e2c22ad7c39ba7ec58bc10071",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e49ae94b3ee3024a2f3f049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我记得澡堂的洗发精好像快用完了。\r\n得去问问负责的职员\r\n还有没有库存才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4eebab183c536b22d2c82b2658647f75393dd3467da5256815aca9cae58d4ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6331f7f194a71b11ae64fa10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走在春天的花径中真舒畅！还能\r\n采到许多看起来很好吃的油菜花。\r\n下次你要不要一起来呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "15a82052873e7c2b6662274ff807474a2a1fe1f63e6ac030bb7bfe5acb348eca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e279031698ead585422883e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天晚上跑步很舒服。\r\n这点我明白……但我不能接受\r\n违反门禁时间的人变多！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3403750dd27055ab8afe84c639f554d78f824e996a0f248a2cf62f230fc1725",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e6fe16e8b3cfa9449ec8910",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「月夜中特别亮眼的婚纱」啊……\r\n……啊，不，是大家在宿舍赏月时\r\n莫名在起哄啦！真是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "933ce84cb0681e580041dd728c89f8d556c74297893dd5ca2e8d626ae35cfedb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb7fa55f82b13da90df3d87e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近一直很冷，我替你\r\n缝了一件棉袍！顺带一提，\r\n花纹跟我的一样喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce19098b3df91125d450c138ee09cf65873df4c3738cf9f502f1b518fc54d78c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92719a5d00399241cea7b2ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？这很有异国风情\r\n又狂野的设计……嘿嘿！\r\n不负「女杰」的名号吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0f20ae6f962a2266673922f187604c4f7404f85908a94c1000f9e516186d75b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:184a5a0d9dc68b1e3e0b7d68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一想到它是婚纱，\r\n该说是觉得害臊吗……\r\n总觉得内心静不下来耶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "693c20df48e4ad967ccbec28c2da64a87784f6802dba2d741ff0972eb8ae7931",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1de507c7ba988ca143297a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好——那么开始训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0366cba1e7248a0db251f3129d48f165db79b02e8a13e4e2b290dfcea1cc48c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e79aeab5d2b7a6ee78c950d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くよっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f75f5ed6e71a6a892ffd950db60dcb6bebc7690e8ca20162fa4b5818b4a198c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4efa519083f293337bfe9ecc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让你见识下你菱亚马逊姐的实力吧\r\n可要好好地跟上来哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee992d8dcaad05f6a1ad499b83b113eb2ea8ab0ad90fbb46ede3cdbcaed812e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d84fcda961c5dbcf4435dde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还想变得更快啊！\r\n开始训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ba3925d8623c28a635f5e92554a89a29db23eadaf095c1a7672e233333053f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1fbfa17bb337b4149fa9124",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练说到底其实就是对自己的单挑。\r\n所以我绝不能认输！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02ad8012771cae2d787b83c867121041c61719dd583f1604d4c3184d8469cf7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8768e10305a6fd4d4c09304",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得更强了这件事、\r\n还真是让人开心啊、训练公！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcf66dbc9e41c754420c9a5bd024a6cf2d1794e2e95637ccd21b4ad9d61b0b22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3303353cdb55900e88d8dc20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会变得越来越强的！\r\n得变得无论单挑的对手是谁、\r\n都不会输的程度才行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e5742fa9aad9b17737295f61f34497b68ae9e9443622a53614bef776af69064",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ae9fb564657c1b67f55aba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要我的搭档是你的话、\r\n感觉无论去到哪里我都能够变强呢！\r\n不觉得这样很让人兴奋不已吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2a206591a4bd5fbbc1a2a2ad7cf48558f05477487c1cac02c5cbe41851fc627",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f85d495f04fce57d6e9b9238",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞！要情绪高涨地上了哦！\r\n无论做什么事情都要全力以赴！\r\n这就是我的作派！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dcdfc7bac12cc9bb265e47558c03cb2e54ea0f8c20039fa4f34ea0fd92f88c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92011"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
